+### Recommended R2 layout
+
+```text
+hexadecilab-media/
+└── videos/
+    └── alps-roadtrip/
+        ├── fallback-1440p.mp4   # default Web HQ
+        ├── master-hevc.mp4      # public original, optional
+        ├── poster.jpg
+        └── metadata.json
+
+hexadecilab-originals/           # private bucket, optional
+└── videos/
+    └── alps-roadtrip/
+        └── master.mp4           # immutable archive
 ```
 
-`videoUrl` is played back with a plain `<video>` tag (see `src/components/media/video-player.astro`)
-— no YouTube/Vimeo re-encode, so whatever you upload is exactly what visitors get.
